The selected source files were obtained from the supplied MP-Manager-main archive. They extend the existing antisplit-m REAndroid source; a second APKEditor JAR is not bundled.
MTAPKTool replaces command/CLI options and the host Protector adapter, completes value-based string naming, adds cancellation checks, and wires output/signing/verification to its own foreground worker pool. Decompilation and cloning implementations are unchanged.
